      "end_timestamp": "01:28",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Burning, yes. Like a stinging, especially after washing my face with soap.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:30",
      "end_timestamp": "01:36",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay. Are there any spots, bumps, or pimples along with the redness?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:37",
      "end_timestamp": "01:42",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Small bumps, yes, a few. Like pimples, but no head on them. They come and go.",
